NOTE ON THIRD-PARTY DATA

This licence covers the code in this repository. It does not and cannot
relicense the datasets the model was derived from, each of which carries its
own terms:

  - Upworthy Research Archive (Matias et al., 2021)
  - Warriner et al. (2013) valence/arousal/dominance norms
  - Brysbaert et al. (2014) concreteness norms
  - sentence-transformers/all-MiniLM-L6-v2, fetched at build time (Apache-2.0)

Derived values ship in resonance/lib/inference/. Before any commercial use,
read the sources' own terms. See docs/papers/README.md.
